msgstr "Mwenye nyumba ameliweka hili kama limetatuliwa. Ukijibu, litafunguliwa tena."

msgid "Message your landlord"
msgstr "Mtumie mwenye nyumba ujumbe"

msgid "For complaints and questions about rent, neighbours, security or services. For repairs, use \"Report a problem\" on your rent page."
msgstr "Kwa malalamiko na maswali kuhusu kodi, majirani, usalama au huduma. Kwa marekebisho, tumia \"Ripoti tatizo\" kwenye ukurasa wako wa kodi."

